    "IK-14884716:L67:span1": {
      "text": "The eviction petition was filed by the Respondent No. 1 on the assertion that its tenant Canara Bank i.e., Respondent No. 2 has let out the Signature Not Verified Digitally Signed CM(M) 380/2023 Page 1 of 13 By:Rashmi Dabas Signing Date:20.10.2023 10:34:02 different portions of the property bearing No. H-61, H Block, Gobind Mansion, Connaught Circus, New Delhi ('subject property') to five (5) sub- tenants without the knowledge and authority of the landlords.",
